WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:04,270
Teacher Nie, I suggest you check our movement track now

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:05,460
Why?

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,940
Rumors are stronger than tigers

4
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:11,010
If you don't check it now, you won't make it through tonight

5
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,010
News that Li Mo cheated in training

6
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:15,010
I'm afraid I won't go anywhere

7
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,010
Then spread throughout the school

8
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,010
You have a conflict with Li Mo

9
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:22,080
Teacher Nie misunderstood

10
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,080
This senior sister Zhou Yi

11
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,850
It's the first time you meet me

12
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:31,100
But she should have a very close friend named Wang Hao and Zhou Yi

13
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,100
Give your record sheet to Zhang Zitao

14
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,100
from now on

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,510
You were taken out of the Qingyuan Guards

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,510
Teacher Nie, I don’t accept it

17
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,670
What Li Mo said was just speculation.

18
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,670
You can't remove me from the escort just because of his speculation.

19
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:43,670
It's indeed a guess

20
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,670
But you dare to say that you didn't intend to do this

21
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:48,670
The escort must be fair and impartial

22
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,670
Those with evil intentions are not worthy of staying

23
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,670
Zhang Zitao, write down the results

24
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,670
Take Li Mo and the others to a safe area to rest.

25
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:54,670
Li Mo, that Wang Hao is going to deal with you

26
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:55,670
Is it because of Lin Ruoyu?

27
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:56,670
Then you have to be careful

28
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,670
Wang Hao is fourth on the combat power list and has great energy.

29
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:00,670
The little trick just now is nothing at all

30
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:02,670
Tell me how much energy he has

31
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:03,670
Old students at the top of the combat power list

32
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:04,670
Influence is divided into two parts

33
00:01:04,670 --> 00:01:05,670
The first is small groups on campus

34
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:06,670
There are many factions in the school

35
00:01:06,670 --> 00:01:08,740
The leaders are all strong ones on the combat power list.

36
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:09,740
Many people under Wang Hao want to curry favor with him

37
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:10,740
People who will cause trouble for you in the future

38
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:11,740
will continue far and wide

39
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:13,740
The Claw Domain brought by Influence

40
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:14,740
What about the second source?

41
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:16,740
The second source is the Chinese Imperial Teachers Association

42
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:18,740
Most of the formal professional imperial teachers have joined the association

43
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:19,740
Pay anonymously

44
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:20,740
Perks to post bounties

45
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:22,740
If Wang Hao is on the dark web of the association

46
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:23,740
Anonymous money to target me

47
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:25,740
The killer hides in the dark and takes action

48
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,740
Even with Lin Ruoyu’s background

49
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,740
Supported by senior officials of Qingyuan University

50
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:31,740
I can't get any real clues either.

51
00:01:31,740 --> 00:01:34,830
The fourth dark web bounty on the combat power list

52
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:35,830
this for me

53
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:37,830
There is indeed some trouble
